<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2025563160"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1674376238"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Different Lives"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Fly By Midnight"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Fictional Illustrations"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:13.060"><div begin="00:16.610" end="03:13.060"><p begin="00:16.610" end="00:23.170" itunes:key="L1">Saw myself two years ago, and I was someone else<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我审视自己</span></p><p begin="00:23.170" end="00:27.200" itunes:key="L2">Back then I loved just like a carousel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时我的爱就像旋转木马一样原地徘徊</span></p><p begin="00:27.200" end="00:30.350" itunes:key="L3">So many faces going in and out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">许多面孔在我脑海中时隐时现</span></p><p begin="00:30.350" end="00:32.540" itunes:key="L4">That's the way it felt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是我当时的感觉</span></p><p begin="00:32.540" end="00:37.960" itunes:key="L5">Like a distant sort of conversation of you and I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好似一场你与我之间遥远的对话</span></p><p begin="00:37.960" end="00:40.270" itunes:key="L6">You and I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你与我</span></p><p begin="00:40.270" end="00:45.970" itunes:key="L7">Feels like I'm running from my reputation every night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每天晚上 感觉我在逃避我的名声</span></p><p begin="00:45.970" end="00:47.440" itunes:key="L8">Every night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每天晚上</span></p><p begin="00:47.440" end="00:51.270" itunes:key="L9">'Cause I've lived different lives, different lives<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我过着截然不同的生活</span></p><p begin="00:51.270" end="00:55.270" itunes:key="L10">Before you ever made me feel alive, feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">截然不同的生活</span></p><p begin="00:55.270" end="00:59.280" itunes:key="L11">I haven't felt this fucking terrified, terrified<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉活力四射</span></p><p begin="00:59.280" end="01:03.830" itunes:key="L12">Before you, ooh, you, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">惊恐不安</span></p><p begin="01:03.830" end="01:07.130" itunes:key="L13">Those were different times, different times<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时过境迁 如今已不似从前</span></p><p begin="01:07.130" end="01:11.380" itunes:key="L14">You're not the one, I was at 25, drunk and high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今非昔比</span></p><p begin="01:11.380" end="01:20.770" itunes:key="L15">Those are all the lives I left behind, left behind for you, ooh, you, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我抛下从前的那些生活</span></p><p begin="01:20.770" end="01:23.220" itunes:key="L16">I see it now (see it now)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我明白</span></p><p begin="01:23.220" end="01:27.170" itunes:key="L17">Few years ahead, it's only you around (you around)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未来的几年时间 只有你陪在我身边</span></p><p begin="01:27.170" end="01:31.120" itunes:key="L18">Hopped off the wave that kept me watered down (watered down)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远离让我苦苦挣扎的浪潮</span></p><p begin="01:31.120" end="01:34.060" itunes:key="L19">And left the old me in a different town<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将以前的我留在一座不同的城市里</span></p><p begin="01:34.060" end="01:36.400" itunes:key="L20">Somewhere it can't be found<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">停留于没有人可以找到的地方</span></p><p begin="01:36.400" end="01:44.370" itunes:key="L21">Like a distant sort of conversation, I try to hide from you, and I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好似一场遥远的对话</span></p><p begin="01:44.370" end="01:49.930" itunes:key="L22">Feels like I'm closer to a revelation every night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每天晚上 感觉我离真相更近一步</span></p><p begin="01:49.930" end="01:51.760" itunes:key="L23">Every night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每天晚上</span></p><p begin="01:51.760" end="01:55.360" itunes:key="L24">'Cause I've lived different lives, different lives<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我过着截然不同的生活</span></p><p begin="01:55.360" end="01:59.110" itunes:key="L25">Before you ever made me feel alive, feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">截然不同的生活</span></p><p begin="01:59.110" end="02:03.290" itunes:key="L26">I haven't felt this fucking terrified, terrified<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉活力四射</span></p><p begin="02:03.290" end="02:08.030" itunes:key="L27">Before you, ooh, you, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在遇到你之前</span></p><p begin="02:08.030" end="02:11.120" itunes:key="L28">Those were different times, different times<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时过境迁 如今已不似从前</span></p><p begin="02:11.120" end="02:15.570" itunes:key="L29">You're not the one, I was at 25, drunk and high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今非昔比</span></p><p begin="02:15.570" end="02:24.930" itunes:key="L30">Those are all the lives I left behind, left behind for you, ooh, you, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我抛下从前的那些生活</span></p><p begin="02:39.930" end="02:43.330" itunes:key="L31">I've lived different lives, different lives<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我过着截然不同的生活</span></p><p begin="02:43.330" end="02:47.040" itunes:key="L32">Before you ever made me feel alive, feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你让我感觉自己充满活力之前</span></p><p begin="02:47.040" end="02:51.230" itunes:key="L33">I haven't felt this fucking terrified, terrified<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉活力四射</span></p><p begin="02:51.230" end="02:56.090" itunes:key="L34">Before you, before you ooh, you, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">惊恐不安</span></p><p begin="02:56.090" end="02:59.090" itunes:key="L35">Those were different times, different times<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时过境迁 如今已不似从前</span></p><p begin="02:59.090" end="03:03.390" itunes:key="L36">You're not the one, I was at 25, drunk and high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今非昔比</span></p><p begin="03:03.390" end="03:13.060" itunes:key="L37">Those are all the lives I left behind, left behind for you, ooh, you, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我抛下从前的那些生活</span></p></div></body></tt>